<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15080" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστάω</span></b> , inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστᾶν,</span>
		
			Ion.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Vict.</u>
					3.68
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρίστηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					4.2.39
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				212.25
			</span></i>; of this tense the Com. also used I pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρίσταμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					496
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Theopomp.Com.
				22
			</span></i>, inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠριστάναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermipp.
					60
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρίστημαι,</span>
			v. infr. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱρ</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				815
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰρ</span> only late, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.387
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i>)]:—<i>take the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄριστον</span> or <i>midday meal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				416
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eq.</u>
				815
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρίστων,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδείπνουν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.7.12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.</u>
				4.6.21
			</span></i>: c. acc. rei, <i>breakfast on,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴα καὶ ῥόδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diod.Com.
					2.37
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				122.5
			</span></i>: pf.
			
				Pass.
			 impers., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρίστηται δ᾽ ἐξαρκούντως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					377
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>eat a second meal,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονοσιτέω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>V M</i><i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Acut.</u>
				30
			</span></i>.</div>
